DESCRIPTION:VIRTUAL EVENT: Join us to explore the latest new services and p
	roduct launches showcased at AWS re:Invent.\nThe event will take place onl
	ine for 3.5 hours with an option to pick your preferred time zone. More in
	formation: http://aws.amazon.com/best-of-reinvent\nJoin the event live at 
	your preferred time zone\nThe event will broadcast live in 3 time zones—
	so you can attend whichever time works best for your schedule: \n*	AMER: J
	anuary 28 – 9:00am Pacific Time (PT/UTC-8)\n*	EMEA: January 29 – 9:00a
	m Central European Time (CET/UTC+1)\n*	APJ: January 29 – 9:00am Singapor
	e Time (SGT/UTC+8)\nWhat to Expect:\n*	Curated\, top-rated technical conte
	nt from AWS re:Invent 2025\n*	Sessions designed for developers and IT prof
	essionals\n*	Interactive Q&A with AWS experts\n*	Available with subtitles 
	in up to 8 languages\n*	Free virtual experience\n
DTEND;TZID="Pacific Standard Time":20260129T033000
